Four years ago today, the battle rap community lost one of its most recognizable and respected figures, PatStay Pat was arguably one of the greatest battle rappers of all time. His charisma, wit, presence, and ability to entertain made him one of the most well-known names in battle rap — not just in Canada, but around the world. But beyond the battles, the accolades, and the unforgettable moments, Pat was a person first.

